# Single (particle, energy) run. Particle type and energy are set
# from the command line (see cnaoRingImpact.cc usage), NOT here --
# for carbon-12 the primary must be built via G4IonTable with the
# correct +6e charge state, which /gun/particle cannot do correctly;
# that logic lives in PrimaryGeneratorAction.cc.
#
# Statistics: start with 1e3-1e4 primaries to check the build runs
# end-to-end; clinical-scale dose maps benefit from more (1e5+),
# at a real computational cost given QBBC's full hadronic physics.

/run/initialize
/run/beamOn 5000
